| physical_plan | SortPreservingMergeExec: [sum(store_sales.ss_ext_sales_price)@3 DESC, d_year@0 ASC NULLS LAST, i_category_id@1 ASC NULLS LAST, i_category@2 ASC NULLS LAST], fetch=100                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |   SortExec: TopK(fetch=100), expr=[sum(store_sales.ss_ext_sales_price)@3 DESC, d_year@0 ASC NULLS LAST, i_category_id@1 ASC NULLS LAST, i_category@2 ASC NULLS LAST], preserve_partitioning=[true]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
