|               |             ProjectionExec: expr=[d_year@1 as d_year, ss_ext_sales_price@5 as ss_ext_sales_price, i_category_id@7 as i_category_id, i_category@8 as i_category]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
