|               |                 BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |                   VirtualExecutionPlan name=sqlite compute_context=memory base_sql=SELECT `dt`.`d_date_sk`, `dt`.`d_year`, `dt`.`d_moy`, `store_sales`.`ss_sold_date_sk`, `store_sales`.`ss_item_sk`, `store_sales`.`ss_ext_sales_price`, `item`.`i_item_sk`, `item`.`i_category_id`, `item`.`i_category` FROM `date_dim` AS `dt` INNER JOIN `store_sales` ON (`dt`.`d_date_sk` = `store_sales`.`ss_sold_date_sk`) INNER JOIN `item` ON (`store_sales`.`ss_item_sk` = `item`.`i_item_sk`) WHERE ((`dt`.`d_moy` = 11) AND (`dt`.`d_year` = 1998)) AND (`item`.`i_manager_id` = 1) |
